<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="iokvb">Top Longevity Doctors: "This Is the Fastest Way to Reverse Biological Age — And It's Coming Out of Shanghai"</div>

<ul id="i2i9t" class="fk-bullet"><li id="i68cd"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="iq25m" class="fk-bullet-list-container"><div data-secondsdelay="" id="ia7mz" class="fk-bullet-icon-container"><i id="irx9y" class="icp icp-auto far fa-calendar-alt"></i></div><div data-secondsdelay="" id="cc-id-jXb7MdPElCNp"><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="io9yv">May 20th, 2026 | 9:14 AM EST &nbsp; · &nbsp;</div></div></div></li></ul>

<div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="itu8i"><div data-box="true" data-secondsdelay="" id="i8yfg">
<div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i2h98">Written by <b>Dr. Marcus Hale, MD</b> | Longevity Medicine &amp; Translational Biology (26 years)&nbsp;</div>

